
# Task 3: KPI Tree

## KPI Tree for the Onboarding and Activation Campaign

The objective of the KPI tree is to illustrate how the primary business goal—converting trial users into paying subscribers—is influenced by key business drivers and supporting metrics. It also highlights the guardrail metrics that ensure growth is achieved without negatively affecting customer experience or operational performance.

---

North Star Metric

Trial-to-Paid Conversion Rate (converted_to_paid)
The percentage of users who convert from a free trial to a paid subscription. This is the primary measure of success because it directly reflects the effectiveness of the onboarding and activation campaign in generating paying customers.

---

